  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "    Naive and mischievous, the young Nina often goes and wrecks the nature
    outside her village despite being scolded for her misbehavior. One night, a Diwata
    tried to stop her from her antics to no avail, causing the destruction of a sacred
    antill that belongs to the Diwata, who turns out to be a Nuno. The Nuno turned
    her into a Manananggal as punishment, but the reckless Nina sees this as a blessing,
    to the Nuno's dismay. The Nuno sets traps to hopefully kill Nina by sunlight,
    but she sees this as her chance to master her abilities and cause more mischief.\n\n\tA/D
    to Move\t\t\t\t\t\tSpacebar to Jump\n\tE to Take/Drop Apple\t\t\tTab to Switch
    Body Control\n\n\tAs Nina, your goal is to go through various puzzles without
    dying. Each level has you control the upper body first, which is the only one
    of the two bodies that has the ability to Take, Drop, and Double Jump."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
